COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."contact"."merged_into_contact_id" IS 'When set, this contact has been merged into the referenced contact and should be hidden from lists/search. Its references were repointed to the target; see public.contact_merge for the snapshot and undo data.';


COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."contact"."enrichment_status" IS 'Web-enrichment lifecycle: NULL = never attempted (the sweep''s candidate set), pending | enriched | failed | skipped. Full result in metadata.enrichment.';


