COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."eval_case"."package_ids" IS 'Packages attached to every capture this case produces — the materialized ids from mock_packages, plus any REAL workspace package ids passed explicitly at create/update (validated with package_visible_to for the caller). Copied onto captures.package_ids by insertTemplateCapture and cloneTrialCapture, which is what makes the live-agent route build a manifest and promote get_package for the trial.';


