COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."user_device"."removed_at" IS 'Environments (420): "Remove this Mac". Its folders are revoked and its environment archived; its heartbeat is refused until a folder is added on that Mac again (the heartbeat''s rejoin clears this). Nothing is deleted.';


COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."user_device"."capabilities" IS 'Environments (420, E2): what the Mac''s app can do, as its heartbeat says (today: baseBranch). Written by the heartbeat only.';


